  "description": "Fetch and inspect any URL as Googlebot, Bingbot or a real browser, directly from your Umbraco site. Follows the full redirect chain, shows response headers per hop, renders the HTML source, and analyses the page for spam/hack keywords, hidden CSS, meta tags and common JavaScript issues. Includes cloaking detection (compares what a bot sees versus what Chrome sees) and a VirusTotal link. Great for SEO debugging, diagnosing hacked/cloaked pages and inspecting redirects. Server-side fetch blocks private/local addresses for safety.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
