  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: URL Viewer + Site URL Scan. Backoffice-secured tool (Settings section, under /umbraco) to fetch a URL as different user agents, follow the redirect chain, view headers/HTML source, and run spam/hidden-CSS/meta/JavaScript analysis with cloaking detection. Adds a recurring Site URL Scan job (auto-discovered by uTPro Job Monitor) that scans all Content/Media URLs, stores summary reports in the database, maintains a standing error-URL list, and supports on-demand re-scan of individual or all failing URLs.",
